  "description": "A high-performance .NET library for creating pixel-perfect PDFs from HTML and URLs using a managed Chromium browser pool. Supports headers, footers, watermarks, encryption, metadata, cookies, custom JavaScript, lazy loading, and more. Targets .NET 6.0 and .NET 8.0+.",
